flowchart TD

Start[User Opens PubliQ]
Upload[Upload Government Documents]
Process[Extract & Chunk Text]
Embed[Generate Embeddings]
Store[Store in ChromaDB]

Query[User Asks Question]
Retrieve[Retrieve Relevant Chunks]
Context[Assemble Context]
LLM[AWS Bedrock Model]
Cite[Attach Source Citations]
Answer[Return Answer to User]

Start --> Upload
Upload --> Process
Process --> Embed
Embed --> Store

Query --> Retrieve
Store --> Retrieve
Retrieve --> Context
Context --> LLM
LLM --> Cite
Cite --> Answer
